The release workflow also publishes `nimvault-macos-amd64` (macOS x86_64, built on the `macos-15-intel` runner; the `macos-13` label was removed in December 2025) and `nimvault-windows-amd64.zip` (a zip whose only entry is `nimvault.exe`), plus one `SHA256SUMS` covering every release asset. `nimvault-linux-amd64`, `nimvault-linux-arm64` and `nimvault-macos-arm64` keep their names, and the Linux binaries stay static musl builds with no libpcre. (release-assets)
